      "updated": 1791302034787,
      "created": 1791300537671,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "C - channels\nW - capture horizontal resolution\nH - capture vertical resolution\nT - temporal resolution <- controlled by the trigger\n\nKinds of shapes we would want to capture:\n\nconcentration field T x W x H x C\naggregated concentration (sum, max, avg, min) T x C\naggregated quantity (sum max avg min) T x C\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "C - channels\nW - capture horizontal resolution\nH - capture vertical resolution\nT - temporal resolution <- controlled by the trigger\n\nKinds of shapes we would want to capture:\n\nconcentration field T x W x H x C\naggregated concentration (sum, max, avg, min) T x C\naggregated quantity (sum max avg min) T x C\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
